'' 'tiko run' (tiko-build B5): builds the one exe target, then runs it with the arguments after
'' '--' -- one with a space in it arrives whole -- and exits with the program's code.
'' TEST: cli
'' ENV: TKO_MODCACHE=build/.brn/cache
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/windows-x86_64
'' CLEAN: build/.brn
'' ARGS: run -target windows-x86_64 tests/driver/src/build-run.tiko -o build/.brn/r.exe -- hello "two words"
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 7
'' EXPECT-OUT: args:hello|two words
